#: scenario7:scenario7_6FC2541E_7EDE_4AA8_A380_23647591A82B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0f097249c93459424855074ba5be3bb7be443459f321ed8fb62800bcc0d4151e
