#: scenario7:scenario7_180E9105_D7F5_4671_98F6_65D3AADBD25C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fa8cce677ef0fc549482b26a7c18fec82a58ba3069023d7c8c8efc04d32bd1c2
#. default-sha256: 43d5ddd646731e91a314495952e78bae151636efbc7c715900cf2bfc260ac2bf
